    {
      "q": "How often is this list updated?",
      "a": "Once a day. A GitHub Action pulls new internship postings from Dreamwork's public API, which crawls company career pages directly (Greenhouse, Lever, Ashby, Workday, and others). Use <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>F</kbd> for software engineering, data science, ML, product, or design roles."
    },
    {
      "q": "Which season are these internships for?",
      "a": "Whatever companies are hiring for right now. In 2026 that is primarily Fall 2026, Spring 2027, and Summer 2027. New season postings appear here the day Dreamwork first verifies them."
    },
    {
      "q": "Why are some internships missing?",
      "a": "This board is intentionally limited to verified-open US tech internships with an internship or co-op title. Closed, duplicate, non-US, and non-tech roles are removed automatically."
    },
    {
      "q": "Graduating soon?",
      "a": "The companion list, <a href=\"https://github.com/dreamworkhq/New-Grad-Software-Engineer-Jobs\">New Grad Software Engineer Jobs</a>, covers entry-level full-time roles with the same daily refresh."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can Dreamwork match these roles to my resume?",
      "a": "Yes. <a href=\"https://www.dreamworkhq.com/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=faq&utm_campaign=gh-tech-internships\">Dreamwork</a> ranks every role against your resume, goals, seniority, and location. Seeing your matches is free."
